    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d251">

                <pb facs="0349" n="335" sameAs="frus:frus1948v06/pg335"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">501.BC Indonesia/9–1348: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Consulate General at
                        Batavia</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">confidential</hi>
                        <lb/>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">us urgent</hi>
                    </seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1948-09-13T15:00:00-04:00">September 13,
                            1948—3 p. m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>415. Usgoc 138. Dept requested US Chiefs Missions Canberra Brussels Sept 10
                    approach FonOffs Australia, Belgium respectively explaining circumstances
                    Indonesia necessitating approach to parties and members GOC suggested Gocus
                        367<anchor n="1" xml:id="d251-f1"/> and asking support those govts USDel
                    plan. Same day Dept called Counselor Brit Emb Wash, made similar explanation
                    similar request, pointing out absolute necessity Brit FonOff avoiding appearance
                    knowledge of plan until Brit ConGen Batavia officially informed. Accordingly,
                    Brit FonOff will not discuss existence plan until Dept receives Cochran’s
                    signal. Dept will take similar steps Sept 13 and 14 Aus Bel Embs Wash, also
                    consider similar conversations Wash representatives India, Pakistan, possibly
                    Philippines. Finally Dept will discuss situation, plan and procedure
                    representatives Indonesia Lake Success Sept 14.<anchor n="2" xml:id="d251-f2"/>
                </p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Marshall</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
